  "description": "Awaken Design is a bold and energetic comic graffiti font crafted to bring a playful urban vibe to any project. Its chunky letterforms with exaggerated curves and sharp edges mimic the expressive strokes of street art while keeping a polished comic-book appeal. The font exudes fun, creativity, and confidence, making it ideal for posters, branding, children’s content, apparel, games, and designs that demand attention with personality and flair.\nThis typeface comes in two styles:Regular – clean, solid graffiti-inspired letters perfect for standalone use.Extrude – layered with a bold outline and depth effect, designed to create striking dimensional titles.\nWhen combined, the two styles allow layered, impactful text effects reminiscent of spray-painted tags and comic headlines, offering flexibility for playful or edgy design aesthetics.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Awaken Design is a bold and energetic comic graffiti font </strong>crafted to bring a playful urban vibe to any project. Its chunky letterforms with exaggerated curves and sharp edges mimic the expressive strokes of street art while keeping a polished comic-book appeal. The font exudes fun, creativity, and confidence, making it ideal for posters, branding, children’s content, apparel, games, and designs that demand attention with personality and flair.</p>\n<p><strong>This typeface comes in two styles:</strong><br>Regular – clean, solid graffiti-inspired letters perfect for standalone use.<br>Extrude – layered with a bold outline and depth effect, designed to create striking dimensional titles.</p>\n<p><strong>When combined, the two styles allow layered, </strong>impactful text effects reminiscent of spray-painted tags and comic headlines, offering flexibility for playful or edgy design aesthetics.</p>",
